{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>The aqqo.</b> It is translated יַעֲלָא — ״יַעֲלֵי סָלַע״ (Job 39); it is אשטנבוק." "<b>The te'o.</b> תּוֹרְבָּלָא — the bull of the forest; בָּלָא is 'forest' in Aramaic."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "Rashi identifies the aqqo with the ibex; אשטנבוק appears to be from Old French estanboc or a similar form for the ibex/goat."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:00.690858027Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}